          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"analise-da-construcao-incremental\">An\u00e1lise da constru\u00e7\u00e3o incremental</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Hor\u00e1rio</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Tempo</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Aulas alteradas (vs H0)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H0</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0.046456098556518555</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">N/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H1 (do zero)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0.039850711822509766</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>31</code> aulas alteradas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H1 (incremental)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0.039699554443359375</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><code>0</code> aulas alteradas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">---</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Temos uma diferen\u00e7a de tempo entre H1 (do zero) e H1 (incremental) de <code>0.00015115737915039062</code>s.</span>\n<h3 id=\"visualizacao-interativa-de-horarios\">Visualiza\u00e7\u00e3o interativa de hor\u00e1rios</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='WpjJ-9' random-id='a4db7076-3730-48bc-4f74-ea92bb9787cb'><marimo-tabs data-initial-value='&quot;&quot;' data-label='null' data-tabs='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eH0 (original)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92